---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Money Calculators - GWill Finance" description="Interactive Nigerian finance calculators. Landing with Phase 2." crumb="Money Calculators">
<section class="con sg" aria-labelledby="tools-h">
<p class="crumbs" style="color:var(--text-dim);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:16px"><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/`} style="color:var(--gold)">Home</a> › Money Calculators</p>
<div class="hold">
<span class="phase-tag">Lands with Phase 2</span>
<h1 class="hold-title" id="tools-h">Money Calculators</h1>
<p style="margin-top:8px">The interactive calculators — currency converter, salary tax, compound interest, and the rest of the toolkit — are being ported with tested math and land with Phase 2. This page holds their place so no link breaks in the meantime.</p>
<ul>
<li>Currency converter (16 currencies, parallel-market estimate)</li>
<li>Salary tax (current vs old bands, rent relief)</li>
<li>Compound interest, savings goal, 50/30/20 budget</li>
<li>Loan repayment, emergency fund, crypto profit and more</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="slink" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/`}>← Back to the homepage</a></p>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
